---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant DB as Evaluators DB

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo evaluators set-state
    activate Vigilo

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Parse evaluator identifier and requested state
    Vigilo->>DB: Update evaluator lifecycle state

    alt Evaluator updated
        DB-->>Vigilo: State update applied
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else Evaluator not updated
        DB-->>Vigilo: No mutable evaluator row
        Vigilo-->>User: State update error
    end

    deactivate Vigilo
